  "rules": [
    "Keep 'Christmas' (its locale value) in the title whenever the English title has it; never drop it, never swap it for New Year/Neujahr/Новый год.",
    "Keep 'Dress Like Mommy' untranslated and never double it in a title (no 'Ντύσου σαν τη Μαμά – Dress Like Mommy').",
